e evaluates the equivalent discount factor with `log1p` and `expm1`, and adds both cases to the existing parametrized test.\n\nValidation:\n\n- `pytest`: 22 passed, 100% project coverage\n- `pre-commit run --all-files`: all hooks passed\n- independent Decimal grid: 640 cases, 0 cent-level mismatches\n- restoring the original expression reproduces the same two failures\n\nFixes #314\n","created_at":"2026-09-27T05:00:32Z","updated_at":"2026-09-27T05:00:32Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"ef647c82cb5834d2117054ae5dc8bd57e9cf4009","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/roniemartinez/amortization/pulls/315/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/roniemartinez/amortization/pulls/315/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/roniemartinez/amortization/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/roniemartinez/amortization/issues/315/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/roniemartinez/amortization/statuses/8e6045b5c00de0eddd84bfb8bcf563111627f813","head":{"label":"kadyrbekovhamit-cyber:fix/small-positive-rate-cancellation","ref":"fix/small-positive-rate-cancellation","sha":"8e6045b5c00de0eddd84bfb8bcf563111627f813","user":{"login":"kadyrbekovhamit-cyber","id":288885044,"node_id":"U_kgDOETgJNA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/288885044?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kadyrbekovhamit-cyber","html_url":"https://github.com/kadyrbekovhamit-cyber","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kadyrbekovhamit-cyber/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kadyrbekovhamit-cyber/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kadyrbekovhamit-cyber/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kadyrbekovhamit-cyber/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.